WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.113
Finally, make it yours. Themes, backgrounds, motion, voice, agents and safety. It's all in Settings.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:10.600
Pick a theme, and every color in the app follows along.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:15.123
Then set the scene, with a living video backdrop, or an image of your own.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:22.190
You can watch this tour again anytime, from Settings, General. Now go build something amazing.
